Sounds to me like you're possibly in AlphaBIOS mode rather than SRM
mode. I don't have long right now, and I'm away from my PWS and docs,
but you need to change mode out of AlphaBIOS before you'll see the SRM
">>>". If it is AlphaBIOS, F2 won't mean VMS PF2, it'll mean PC F2.
AlphaBIOS is intended for use from a VGA console but there was some
limited serial support (as it seems you may have discovered). If you
can find the docs or equivalent,  you should hopefully be able to make
it work well enough to change the environment variable which controls
whether to pick AlphaBIOS or SRM.

You might get somewhere quite quickly by searching for "PWS AlphaBIOS
SRM". I got a few relevant hits but the frst two were unresponsive
(one was an archive of this ng, one was digitalpw.html at in the Alpha
firmware archive at ftp.digital.com). At that point I had to move on.

Best of luck
John


