This might be due to a empty battery on the MLB. When that happens, the 
default behaviour is to redirect the console to graphics. Even if you 
change the setting to serial, every time you power cycle the machine, 
the SRM parameters are turned to default settings.
Try to set console serial and do not power cycle, but issue the command 
init instead. Then you should get the serial console working.




